      "created_at": "2016-09-27T23:33:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Rites of Revival says to flip a \"hero character card,\" so you could use it on any of the sentinels without all of them being flipped, and not all four could be flipped at once.&nbsp;</p><p>I assume that if you bring one of them back (or more on succesive turns,) their set-up card stays flipped, which is very interesting if true.&nbsp;</p>",
