      "id": 182924,
      "name": "MigrantP",
      "username": "MigrantP",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/{size}/1921_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-09-28T17:44:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It's probably a bug, but we'll make sure. The following is going to be in the fireside chats (when approved by Christopher):</p><p><em>Suppose Sky-Scraper is incapacitated and has used the “become a target” incapacitated ability. If she is revived using Rites of Revival, the 1 HP indestructible target status is wiped, and she is her regular self at 8 HP with a 33 HP max and is fully destructible. Rites of Revival essentially resets the character, starting anew.</em></p><p>I think it follows that unlucky pool should also be reset.</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:08:02.346Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
