      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>It&#39;s probably a bug, but we&#39;ll make sure. The following is going to be in the fireside chats (when approved by Christopher):</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: Helvetica;\"><em>Suppose Sky-Scraper is incapacitated and has used the &ldquo;become a target&rdquo; incapacitated ability. If she is revived using Rites of Revival, the 1 HP indestructible target status is wiped, and she is her regular self at 8 HP with a 33 HP max and is fully destructible. Rites of Revival essentially resets the character, starting anew.</em></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: Helvetica;\">I think it follows that unlucky pool should also be reset.</p>",
